# Build context exclusions.
#
# This file and .gcloudignore must stay in agreement. .gcloudignore is
# `#!include:.gitignore`, so `gcloud builds submit` already drops notes/,
# the model caches, DEMO.md and friends -- while this file did not, which
# meant a local `docker build` and a CD build produced DIFFERENT images
# from the same commit. Two build paths that disagree is worse than either
# being wrong, because only one of them is ever the one you inspected.
#
# The image needs exactly three things: app/, pyproject.toml and uv.lock.
# Everything else here is excluded, and anything new added to the repo root
# should be assumed to belong on this list until shown otherwise.

# --- Environments and caches ---
venv/
.venv/
testenv/
testenv2/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.ruff_cache/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/

# Model caches. Critical: these resolve to the SAME paths the Dockerfile's
# pre-download steps write to (/app/.fastembed_cache, /app/.flashrank_cache).
# Copying a developer's local cache in would shadow those steps -- shipping
# whatever was on one laptop (including the __MACOSX/AppleDouble junk a
# zip-extracted model leaves behind) instead of a clean, reproducible pull.
.fastembed_cache/
.flashrank_cache/

# --- Secrets and local config ---
# .env.* covers .env.example too, deliberately -- a template of every
# secret name the app reads is documentation, not a runtime dependency.
.env
.env.*
.python-version

# --- Not needed at runtime ---
docs/
tests/
scripts/
eval.py
eval_ragas.py
eval_results.json
ragas_results.json
.coverage
htmlcov/

# --- Repo/tooling metadata ---
.git/
.gitignore
.dockerignore
.gcloudignore
.github/
.gstack/
Dockerfile
cloudrun-*.yaml

# --- Documentation and working notes ---
# notes/ and DEMO.md carry job-search material that CLAUDE.md's
# repository-voice rule keeps out of the tracked repo. Untracked is not the
# same as un-shipped: without these lines a local build baked them into a
# container served on the public internet.
README.md
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md
TODOS.md
DEMO.md
FIX_PLAN.md
AUTOPLAN-REVIEW-*.md
notes/
design/

# --- Logs and scratch ---
logs/
*.log
*.txt
